  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added the `Generate SHA256SUMS.txt` step in the `publish` job of `.github/workflows/release.yml` after `At least one asset to publish`.\n- The step changes into `dist/`, collects all present release assets with `shopt -s nullglob` (`*.zip`, `*-setup.exe`, `*.tar.gz`, `*.deb`, `*.rpm`, `*.dmg`, `*.AppImage`, `*.snap`, `*.flatpak`, `*.pkg.tar.zst`), writes `SHA256SUMS.txt` with basenames, and checks it with `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt`.\n- Added `dist/SHA256SUMS.txt` to the `files:` list of `softprops/action-gh-release@v2`.\n- Left all workflow triggers (`on:`), job dependencies, `xtask/`, and `scripts/` unchanged.\n\n## Review note\n\n- This change edits `.github/workflows/release.yml`, so it expects `needs-maintainer` manual review.\n- This PR addresses Part A of `#2428` alongside the existing held PR `#3110`.\n\n## Readings and checks\n\nVerified on commit `863fae5ba` by an independent `gate-runner`:\n- Changed files: `.github/workflows/release.yml` only.\n- YAML validity (`python` `yaml.safe_load`): exit 0 (`['name', True, 'env', 'permissions', 'jobs']`).\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: exit 0 (`0 step(s), 0 failed`).\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy --base origin/main --dry-run`: none reached.\n- `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -j 6 -- -D warnings`: exit 0.\n- `xtask` tests: `release_site_tests` 3/3 passed, `package_paths_tests` 4/4 passed, `release_tests` 17/17 passed.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Live GitHub tag release workflow execution and artifact upload on `softprops/action-gh-release@v2`.\n\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: none\nEffort: low\n\nRefs #2428\n",
